<title>ESTONIA: KLEMENTI H1 PROFIT 600,998 KROONS.</title>
<headline>KLEMENTI H1 PROFIT 600,998 KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1997 vs 1996</p>
<p>				    (million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit				600,998 vs  4.3</p>
<p> Turnover				     37.0 vs 86.4</p>
<p> Operating costs			    42.7 vs 96.4</p>
<p> Operating profit			    2.0 vs 67.4</p>
<p>NOTE -- Klementi, a clothing manufacturer and retailer, is</p>
<p>traded on the secondary list of the Tallinn stock exchange.</p>
